From 3646c93a8fd35dd03257bd624fa4fc17d107d9ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xubwa <xwang405@jh.edu>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 01:18:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add int3c1e_ipvip1_r{2,4,6}_origk

<nabla i| r_k^2m |nabla j> with the k-centred Gaussian, m = 1, 2, 3: the
derivative counterparts of int3c1e_r{2,4,6}_origk (nine components,
index 3a+b for <d_a i|...|d_b j>), the same way int3c1e_ipvip1 extends
int3c1e.  Generated by auto_intor.cl into src/autocode/int3c1e.c (the
existing functions there are unchanged).

Use: matrix elements of sigma.p V sigma.p for local potentials expanded in
r^2m exp(-zeta r^2) about atomic centres (small-component blocks of
relativistic model potentials built from spherical atomic densities).

Tests: central differences of int3c1e_ip1_r{2,4,6}_origk in the ket centre
(run_fd_ket in testsuite/test_int3c1e.py; also applied to the existing
int3c1e_ipvip1 against int3c1e_ip1 as a control); all pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0192gcYtimetbr1fWAjbzXTX
